\f0\fs24 \cf0 Hallo everyone!\
\
This is an free implementation of the I.263 decoder. It's probably not the fastest one but it's full and free! It can be easily optimized for better performance on particularly processor/machine. Now it works fine in my PPC-Macintosh.\
\
Usage of this decoder:\
\
1) Create an instance of the I263Decoder object\
2) Call I263Decoder::DecodeFrame with following parameters:\
	\CocoaLigature0 inputData - the pointer to the input frame (from a AVI file)\
	framesize - size of this frame (from an AVI file)\
	outData - the pointer to a YUY2 output buffer\
	row_offset - offset to the next row in the output buffer\
3) Destroy the I263Decoder object\
\
Have fun!}